cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the associated paper (preferred-citation) and the software itself."
type: software
title: "birmrssim: Simulation Tools for the Beta Item Response Model with Response Styles (BIRM-RS)"
version: 0.1.1
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.20305322
license: GPL-3.0-or-later
repository-code: "https://github.com/donvollb/birmrssim"
abstract: >-
  Evaluates parameter recovery in the Beta Item Response Model with Response
  Styles (BIRM-RS). Provides functions to simulate data from the BIRM-RS, fit
  the model via Stan, and summarize parameter recovery across customizable
  simulation conditions (e.g., sample size, number of items, presence of ERS
  and ARS). Stan model files for four model variants (with and without ERS and
  ARS) are included.
keywords:
  - item response theory
  - beta item response model
  - response styles
  - visual analogue scales
  - simulation
  - Stan
  - R
